---
permalink: /index.html
description: Licensed security officers for venues, events, shops and offices across Manchester and the North West. Door supervisors, event security, patrols and CCTV monitoring. Call 020 3757 2767, 24 hours.
bodyClass: page-home
schemaPage: business
---
{% from "macros.njk" import arrow, serviceRows, finale, map %}
<section class="cover" aria-labelledby="cover-title">
  <div class="wrap cover-grid">
    <div class="cover-text">
      <h1 class="cover-h1" id="cover-title">
        <span class="display"><span class="dl">On site.</span><span class="dl">On time.</span><span class="dl dl--o">On record.</span></span>
        <span class="lede">Licensed security officers for venues, events, shops and offices across Manchester and the North&nbsp;West.</span>
      </h1>
      <div class="cover-actions" id="cover-actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact#quote">Get a quote</a>
        <a class="tel" href="{{ site.phoneHref }}"><span class="tel-l">Need cover tonight? Call 24/7</span><span class="tel-n" translate="no">{{ site.phone }}</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cover-art" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg class="cover-sg" viewBox="0 0 351.64 453.19" focusable="false"><use href="#ss-shield"/></svg>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <ul class="facts">
      <li><b>SIA licensed</b>Every officer. <a href="{{ site.siaRegister }}" rel="noopener">Check any badge on the public register</a>.</li>
      <li><b>Vetted to BS&nbsp;7858</b>The British Standard for screening security staff.</li>
      <li><b>Insured</b>Certificates sent with every quote.</li>
      <li><b>Registered company</b>{{ site.legalName }}, no.&nbsp;<span class="data" translate="no">{{ site.companyNumber }}</span>.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="services-title">Six services. One number to call.</h2>
      <p class="sec-lede">Every booking comes with <strong>a named supervisor</strong>, the licence number of every officer before the shift, and a written report the next morning.</p>
    </div>
    {{ serviceRows(services) }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--paper" id="record" aria-labelledby="record-title">
  <div class="wrap record">
    <div>
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2 class="sec-title" id="record-title">You’ll know who is on your door.</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="promises">
        <li><h3>Before the shift</h3><p>The name and SIA licence number of every officer, by email.</p></li>
        <li><h3>During the shift</h3><p>One supervisor you can reach, on site or by phone, all night.</p></li>
        <li><h3>After the shift</h3><p>A written report the next morning, every incident logged with the time.</p></li>
      </ul>
      <a class="link link--solo record-more" href="/how-we-work">How we vet, brief and report{{ arrow() }}</a>
    </div>
    <figure class="doc-fig">
      {% include "report.njk" %}
      <figcaption>What lands in your inbox the next morning. A sample with invented details.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="area" aria-labelledby="area-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="area-title">Based in Manchester. On call across the North&nbsp;West.</h2>
      <p class="sec-lede">Our office is on Cheetham Hill Road, just north of the city centre. We work most often in <strong>{{ site.areas | join(", ") | replace(", Bury", " and Bury") }}</strong>. Further afield? Call us and we’ll tell you straight away if we can cover it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="area">
      {{ map(site, "area", "Map of Greater Manchester showing our office and the areas we cover") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="careers" aria-labelledby="careers-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <h2 class="sec-title" id="careers-title">Good officers get steady shifts.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="careers">
      <div class="careers-copy">
        <p>If you hold an SIA door supervisor or security guard licence, you can apply from your phone in a few minutes. No&nbsp;CV needed.</p>
        <p>We pay weekly, with overtime when you want it.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/careers">See all roles</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="roles">
        {% for r in roles %}
        <li><a href="/careers#apply" data-role="{{ r.code }}"><span class="role-t">{{ r.title }}</span><span class="role-m">{{ r.place }} · {{ r.pattern }}</span><span class="role-go">Apply{{ arrow() }}</span></a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{{ finale(site, "<b>Answered 24 hours, every day.</b> Need cover tonight? Call. Planning ahead? Send the site, the dates and the hours, and we’ll reply with a price and the officers we’d send.") }}
